# Execution

All scripts are located inside the `scripts` directory.

Open PowerShell/Git Bash from the project root and execute the required script using its corresponding command.

Example:

```powershell
.\scripts\step_a.ps1
```

The scripts should be executed in the order specified in the project instructions.

# Repository

This repository contains the implementation files, scripts, data-processing workflow, and documentation for the ShopSphere distributed data platform project.
